<title>USA: Forest City Enterprises Q1 shr loss $0.02.</title>
<headline>Forest City Enterprises Q1 shr loss $0.02.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.02     loss	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss		     219     loss	   946</p>
<p> Revs		     151,068		  128,971</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,112		   13,287</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended April 30.</p>
<p>The 1997 Q1 results include a net loss of $21.5 million, or $1.64 per share, on the sale of a property, and a net gain of $11.5 million, or $0.84 a share, on the extinguishment of certain debt.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Forest City Enterprises Inc.</p>
